WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
In Corinth, much of the meat on sale
had passed through a temple sacrifice.

2
00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:09.500
Some believers had a slogan:
All things are lawful for me.

3
00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:13.550
At the Lord's Supper, one is
hungry, and another is drunken.

4
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.730
So, if all things are lawful,
what was Paul's answer?

5
00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:22.130
In this mission, you'll test the
Corinthians' slogans against Paul's replies,

6
00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:23.540
one by one.

7
00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:26.710
Then you'll read the earliest
account of the Last Supper,

8
00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:29.810
and see how churches read
these chapters today.

9
00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:34.850
Your mission: find out how Paul answered
the claim that all things are lawful.
